NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only.

It does NOT cover the figures and tables under `data_processed/`, which are
derived products whose terms follow from their input datasets. The
Biodiversity Intactness Index (BII) v2.1.1 is CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0, so outputs
computed from it carry non-commercial and share-alike obligations. GRIP4 is
ODbL; administrative boundaries are (c) EuroGeographics; other inputs are
CC-BY with attribution requirements of their own.

See `data_sources.md` for the licence attached to each input layer, and the
licence section of `README.md` for what that means in practice.
